  "category": "happy",
  "expr": "smile",
  "source_bucket": "巧遇",
  "text": "……多謝。肯靜靜聽我講晒嘅人，真係冇幾個。",
  "occurrences": [
   {
    "src": "ENC",
    "speaker": "luk_baakyin",
    "reachable": true,
    "reach_why": "ENC"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "char": "luk_baakyin",
  "category": "happy",
  "expr": "smile",
  "source_bucket": "巧遇",
  "text": "唞……你講得輕鬆。不過，呢句說話，我收咗，多謝。",
  "occurrences": [
   {
    "src": "ENC",
    "speaker": "luk_baakyin",
    "reachable": true,
    "reach_why": "ENC"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "char": "luk_baakyin",
  "category": "happy",
  "expr": "smile",
  "source_bucket": "巧遇",
  "text": "好。唔使多謝我，行好你自己嗰段路就得。",
  "occurrences": [
   {
    "src": "ENC",
    "speaker": "luk_baakyin",
    "reachable": true,
    "reach_why": "ENC"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "char": "liu_bingxing",
  "category": "surprise",
  "expr": "surprise",
  "source_bucket": "巧遇",
  "text": "咦，隔籬枱嗰個後生仔，又係你呀？",
  "occurrences": [
